{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore battlefields and collect weapons:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the dust of battle settles, you arrive at the scene to help the wounded soldiers of Danburg. It looks like no danger appears on the horizon. There are plenty of weapon remnants around - swords, shields, helmets... Take this great opportunity to your advantage, and decide who to help and who to rob! Observe the surroundings, collect weapons, take armor, sort and choose the best of them. When you have collected enough weapons, head to the workshop. Just remember, your cart cannot carry everything you collect!!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591750/extras/GIF1.gif?t=1744826402\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Renew items:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grab the hammer! It's time to work on those crooked arms. Heat it up a bit and choose the right tool to repair the sword. A set of reliable tools awaits you. Using these tools will also give you experience that you can use to improve your skills, making your work even more efficient and enjoyable. Clean up the mess after the armor and keep tinkering. Your effort can fix a lot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591750/extras/GIF2.gif?t=1744826402\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sell your wares:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All your efforts support your comrades, but they also help you earn extra money. Trade with others to acquire new resources and items. Help your city and protect your workshop by using the powerful skills you possess. Immerse yourself in the world of upgrades and help people win this war!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591750/extras/GIF3.gif?t=1744826402\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong> Learn the history hidden in the annals of the Kingdom of Danburg:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world is full of secrets and intrigue. Look around carefully, because some residents may need your help. Talk to them to gain valuable information or receive special tasks to complete. Remember that people always pay handsomely for help!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591750/extras/GIF5.gif?t=1744826402\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2591750?t=1744826402","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2591750?t=1744826402","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591750/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744826402","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591750/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744826402","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This Game may contain content not appropriate for all ages. General Mature Content"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore battlefields and collect weapons:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the dust of battle settles, you arrive at the scene to help the wounded soldiers of Danburg. It looks like no danger appears on the horizon. There are plenty of weapon remnants around - swords, shields, helmets... Take this great opportunity to your advantage, and decide who to help and who to rob! Observe the surroundings, collect weapons, take armor, sort and choose the best of them. When you have collected enough weapons, head to the workshop. Just remember, your cart cannot carry everything you collect!!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591750/extras/GIF1.gif?t=1744826402\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Renew items:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grab the hammer! It's time to work on those crooked arms. Heat it up a bit and choose the right tool to repair the sword. A set of reliable tools awaits you. Using these tools will also give you experience that you can use to improve your skills, making your work even more efficient and enjoyable. Clean up the mess after the armor and keep tinkering. Your effort can fix a lot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591750/extras/GIF2.gif?t=1744826402\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sell your wares:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All your efforts support your comrades, but they also help you earn extra money. Trade with others to acquire new resources and items. Help your city and protect your workshop by using the powerful skills you possess. Immerse yourself in the world of upgrades and help people win this war!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591750/extras/GIF3.gif?t=1744826402\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong> Learn the history hidden in the annals of the Kingdom of Danburg:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world is full of secrets and intrigue. Look around carefully, because some residents may need your help. Talk to them to gain valuable information or receive special tasks to complete. Remember that people always pay handsomely for help!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591750/extras/GIF5.gif?t=1744826402\" /></p>","developers":["Code Horizon"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2052650","name":"Sword & Shield Simulator"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591750/header.jpg?t=1744826402","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257124382,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257124382/movie480.mp4?t=1744401740","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257124382/movie_max.mp4?t=1744401740"},"name":"Sword&Shield Demo","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257124382/f5a5f9f583bcb383367c062b5bb00f07a3aae115/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1744401740","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257124382/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1744401740","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257124382/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1744401740"}},{"highlight":false,"id":257124392,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257124392/movie480.mp4?t=1744312211","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257124392/movie_max.mp4?t=1744312211"},"name":"Sword&Shield Cinematic","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257124392/a3af8aada285